	(text "R205/R206 (0 Ω): BC1.2 on the\nshared USB D+/D− pair."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a5fefbe6-d9f1-55c0-8f6e-6d52ca702e59")
	)
	(text "• BQ25798: 2S buck-boost charger, 3.6–24 V inputs.\n  USB-C 5 V (VAC1, BC1.2) and 12 V dock (VAC2);\n  NVDC power path: SYS ≥ VSYSMIN 7.0 V with input.\n• Firmware at boot: watchdog kick or disable;\n  VAC_OVP = 18 V (reg 0x10); ICHG 2.0 A; VREG 8.40 V;\n  IINDPM from CC (USB) or 2.5 A (dock); HVDCP off.\n• IBAT discharge 6 A RMS / 10 A for 1 s (BATFET).\n• ILIM_HIZ = REGN·10/14.7: hardware input limit\n  ≈ 2.8–3.0 A (the lower of pin and IINDPM wins).\n• PROG 8.2 kΩ → 2S, 750 kHz. TS 5.23k/30.1k + 10 kΩ\n  NTC (103AT): JEITA 0–60 °C. R209 only without NTC.\n• R214 holds ~CE low: charging enabled in hardware;\n  EN_CHG over I2C. STAT unused (DIS_STAT = 1): state over\n  I2C, shown on the face display. TP201: QON.\n• Capacitors with no voltage rating: X7R 50 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d4fb4d5-8c3c-582d-98e2-0c0885a5376e")
	)
